---

<section class="relative pt-12 pb-20 px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center overflow-hidden">
  
  {/* Aviso Topo */}
  <div class="mb-8 mt-4">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 bg-red-950/40 rounded-full border border-red-900/50">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-red animate-pulse"></span>
      <span class="text-brand-red font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.15em]">Conteúdo Restrito</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Headline Principal - Foco na dor e na curiosidade */}
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-6 mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight md:leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
      PROJETO DE BAIXO CUSTO QUE GERA <span class="text-brand-red">32CV</span> E FAZ A MOTO PASSAR DOS <span class="relative inline-flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-1.5 ml-1 text-white italic z-10 leading-none"><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-red -skew-x-12 -z-10 rounded-md"></span>200KM/H</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg md:text-xl font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      Projetinho diferenciado com pouca cilindrada, simples de fazer e que passa dos 200… assista o vídeo antes que saia do ar
    </p>
  </div>

  {/* VSL (Vídeo) */}
  <div class="w-full max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-12 relative group z-10">
    {/* Efeito visual atrás do vídeo */}
    <div class="absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-b from-brand-red to-black rounded-xl blur-2xl opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition duration-700"></div>
    
    <div class="w-full rounded-xl relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-2xl bg-[#0a0a0a] aspect-video">
      {/* Placeholder para evitar CLS */}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#0a0a0a] flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-brand-red rounded-full flex items-center justify-center animate-pulse">
           <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white ml-1" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"/></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <iframe 
        id="panda-5165e69f-f0bd-4929-9fe5-c9dd7b0e2a21" 
        src="https://player-vz-8c69785c-727.tv.pandavideo.com.br/embed/?v=5165e69f-f0bd-4929-9fe5-c9dd7b0e2a21" 
        style="border:none;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;" 
        allow="accelerometer;gyroscope;autoplay;encrypted-media;picture-in-picture" 
        allowfullscreen="true" 
        width="100%" 
        height="100%" 
        loading="lazy"
        title="Vídeo de Apresentação">
      </iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* Botão de Compra - Sem delay para melhor conversão e performance */}
  <div id="hero-cta-container" class="w-full max-w-md mx-auto transition-all duration-1000">
    <a href="#oferta" class="block w-full py-5 px-6 bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-red-dark text-white text-xl md:text-xl font-black rounded-lg shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,51,51,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(255,51,51,0.5)] transition-all transform hover:-translate-y-1 uppercase tracking-wider">
      GARANTIR VAGA COM DESCONTO
    </a>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-500 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
      <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-green-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"></path></svg>
      Acesso imediato e seguro
    </p>
  </div>

</section>
